},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_35","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Tu veux progresser ? Ça passe par ces footings bien lents pendant les semaines de récupération alors ne cours pas plus vite, tu auras l'occasion de te fatiguer à nouveau la semaine prochaine rassure-toi !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1793577600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.158357771260997,"expectedDuration":2100},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2100,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"On accompagne ce footing de quelques lignes droites pour te garder actif dans ta foulée ! Quand tu accélères le rythme, tous tes muscles / tes tendons / tes articulations sont sollicités de manière un peu plus intense et vont ainsi se détendre. C'est contre-intuitif mais comme l'effort est rapide mais pas maximal et qu'il est court, ça ne génère pas de fatigue, juste du positif pour ta foulée !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":191,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":594,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1793577600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.908154335109241,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":594}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":191}},{"kind":"RECOVE